 "remarks": "Welcome home to this exceptional lower North Stamford Ranch, privately situated on a desirable cul-de-sac, a true testament to pride of ownership and lovingly maintained by the same family for over 60 years! Step inside to a sun-drenched living room with fireplace that flows seamlessly into the dining room and fabulous four-season, skylit sunroom featuring walls of glass and sliders to the yard. The well-appointed kitchen offers granite countertops, stainless steel appliances including a new cook top & wall oven. A private bedroom wing features a spacious primary br w/full bath, walk-in closet and private balcony, along with two additional bedrooms and hall bath. Finished lower level offers a comfortable family room with second fireplace, office area, half bath and convenient access to the 2-car garage. Enjoy the beautifully landscaped grounds, flower gardens with natural stone and an elevated patio overlooking a peaceful wooded backdrop. Freshly painted interior, whole-house generator complete this special offering.",
